{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-empire-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"empire-residence-empire-development-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Empire Residence is a premium residential complex with apartments from the developer Empire Development, consisting of 15 floors and a 4-storey podium. The complex is designed in a modern architectural style and is located in the developed area of JVC in Dubai.Elegant studios and spacious 1 and 2 bedroom apartments with a variety of layouts are available for sale. The panoramic windows offer incredible views of the Dubai skyline. The interiors are premium and made using modern design solutions. All apartments are equipped with safe and modern Smart Home technology, which allows you to open the door with a fingerprint.Premium amenities are provided for residents of Empire Residence. Inside the complex there is a large infinity pool with a relaxation area, a gym with modern equipment, an open-air cinema, a children's playground, a barbecue area, an enclosed guarded parking lot. The complex has an advantageous location, providing convenient access to key infrastructure facilities, shopping malls and restaurants, entertainment facilities and shopping areas. The area is also famous for its quiet and peaceful environment and abundance of green open spaces. The social infrastructure is also well developed - there are hospitals, schools, supermarkets nearby. Dubai International Airport can be reached in 20 minutes by car, Mall of The Emirates in 10 minutes by car, Al Maktoum International Airport in 20 minutes by car, Palm Islands in 15 minutes by car.","price":990000,"title":"Empire Residence","bitrix":{"id":669,"pf_id":"are.2.12440","source":null,"project_id":"Empire Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Empire Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Empire Developments","project_location":"Jumeirah